# Scripts
# - The entire scripts/ folder is excluded from TypeScript compilation in tsconfig.json
#   so scripts cannot break the main app build.
# - Only the root-level utility scripts (assert-env-local-only.cjs, patch-dlmm-esm.js)
#   and scripts/utils/ are required for the build process.
# - dev/ and archive/ contain test and historical scripts. These are now committed
#   so that important testing evidence (e.g. low-level DLMM path validation) is visible
#   in the repository history.